sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor ST as Student
  participant PWA as React PWA
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant AI as AI services
  participant DB as PostgreSQL + pgvector
  participant FS as File storage

  ST->>PWA: Upload CV (PDF / DOCX)
  PWA->>API: POST /students/me/cv<br/>(JWT bearer)
  API->>API: Check role,<br/>size ≤ 5 MB, type
  API->>FS: Store file (private)
  API->>AI: Extract text and<br/>candidate skills
  alt Text found
    AI-->>API: Skills normalised<br/>with the vocabulary
  else Image-only file
    AI-->>API: No text
    Note over API: FR-PRF-05: ask for<br/>manual skill entry
  end
  API->>DB: Save CV version<br/>and candidate skills
  API-->>PWA: 201 Created +<br/>candidate skills
  ST->>PWA: Confirm or edit skills
  PWA->>API: PUT /students/me/skills
  API->>AI: Embed CV text +<br/>confirmed skills
  AI->>DB: Store embedding

  ST->>PWA: Open "Recommended<br/>vacancies"
  PWA->>API: GET /vacancies/ranked
  API->>DB: Eligible open vacancies<br/>(cycle, major, GPA)
  alt Embedding model available
    API->>AI: Hybrid score: cosine similarity<br/>+ required-skill overlap + rules
    AI-->>API: Fit scores, matched<br/>and missing skills
  else Model unavailable (FR-MAT-04)
    API->>API: Rule-based score only,<br/>label "Basic matching"
  end
  API-->>PWA: Ranked list (advisory)<br/>with explanation
  PWA-->>ST: Fit score, matched<br/>and missing skills
